name 'ai-generated-design-postassessment-q12_2026'

question 'A web designer uses AI to generate a landing page, but the images don\'t align correctly and some text overlaps the buttons. What is the best way to solve these problems?'

wrong 'Continue running the same prompt until the AI randomly fixes the layout.'
wrong 'Replace all the text with images to cover up the problem.'
right 'Adjust the prompt to describe the issues clearly, test the new output, and refine again if needed.'
wrong 'Stop using AI and leave the page unfinished.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lessons 3, 6, 10
MARKDOWN
